        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right: not its child."
      },
      {
        "text": "`GlobalScope` coroutines never run",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It started; the program ended first."
      },
      {
        "text": "The `@OptIn` annotation disabled it",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "`@OptIn` only allows the API."
      },
      {
        "text": "`delay` does not work outside `runBlocking`",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It works in any coroutine."
      }
    ]
